          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Ominous Mien",
      "actions": 1,
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "Requirements The disciple is in Lurker Stance\n\n---\nEffect The disciple gains a +2 circumstance bonus to Intimidation checks and their demoralize attempts don't take a penalty for not speaking the target's language and don't cause the target to become temporarily immune. These effects last until the end of the disciple's next turn.",
